Package: pamPatterns
Type: Package
Title: Pattern Analysis for Passive Acoustic Monitoring Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Lucas",
                   family = "Beseler",
                   email = "lucas.beseler@hs-anhalt.de",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for reading acoustic detection data (e.g., from
    BirdNET), calculating a comprehensive set of quantitative pattern
    indicators related to confidence scores, temporal distribution, and
    spatial ubiquity. Facilitates quality control, identification of
    potential irregularities, and prioritization for manual validation of
    acoustic monitoring results. The focus is on uncovering patterns in PAM data.
